# What git must never record. (A comment must sit on its own line: text after a pattern is
# part of the pattern.) Explained in docs/06-run-and-verify.md, "Publishing the project safely".

# ---- big downloads: get them again with docs/01-setup-and-models.md ----
models/
*.gguf
bin/

# ---- private data ----
# conversation logs and "always allow" answers (one folder per project)
.localagent/
